==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Gray838.png|thumb|Autonomic nervous system]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[autonomic]] [[nervous]] [[system]]|-}}

# {{neuroanatomy}} In [[human]]s and other [[vertebrate]]s, the part of the [[nervous system]] that regulates the involuntary activity of the [[heart]], [[intestine]]s and glands. These activities include [[digestion]], [[respiration]], [[perspiration]], [[metabolism]], and the modulation of [[blood pressure]].

